<td id="mwBbY">Píng Nà</td>
<td id="mwBbc">This stroke has been merged into stroke <b id="mwBbg">N</b> in Unicode.<sup about="#mwt159" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-IRGN1174_9-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"IRGN1174"}}'><a href="#cite_note-IRGN1174-9" id="mwBbk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBbo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBbs">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBbw">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwBb0">是 走 廴</td></tr>
<tr id="mwBb4">
<td id="mwBb8"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBcA"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_ufp.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBcE"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_ufp.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Cjk_m_str_ufp.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_ufp.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Cjk_m_str_ufp.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_ufp.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="30" width="30" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBcI"/></a></span></td>
