<td id="mwBcQ"><b id="mwBcU">TPN</b><sup about="#mwt160" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-bishop_7-13" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"bishop"}}'><a href="#cite_note-bishop-7" id="mwBcY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBcc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBcg">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBck">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwBco">Tí Píng Nà</td>
<td id="mwBcs">This stroke has been merged into stroke <b id="mwBcw">TN</b> in Unicode.<sup about="#mwt161" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-IRGN1174_9-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"IRGN1174"}}'><a href="#cite_note-IRGN1174-9" id="mwBc0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBc4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBc8">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBdA">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwBdE">辶 之 辷</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwBdI">Note that some names in the list do not follow the rules of controlled vocabulary.  For example, stroke P (<i id="mwBdM">Piě)</i> is not found in the compound stroke PN. The name "PN" comes from 平捺 (pinyin: <i id="mwBdQ">Píng Nà</i>), not 撇捺 (pinyin: <i id="mwBdU">Piě Nà</i>).  The meaning of 平 (pinyin: <i id="mwBdY">Píng</i>) is "flat", and it should be called "BN" 扁捺 (pinyin: Biǎn Nà) if the rules are to be followed closely. The letter "Z" in stroke SWZ means 左 (pinyin: <i id="mwBdc">Zuǒ</i>), not 折 (pinyin: <i id="mwBdg">Zhé</i>).  The meaning of 左 is "left", and it is not defined in the naming convention.  Moreover, some 折 (pinyin: <i id="mwBdk">Zhé</i>) strokes are far more than or far less than 90°, such as stroke HZZZG, stroke HZZP and stroke PZ.</p>

<p id="mwBdo">Some strokes are not included in the Unicode standard, such as <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBds"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_du.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBdw"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_du.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Cjk_m_str_du.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_du.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Cjk_m_str_du.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_du.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBd0"/></a></span>, <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBd4"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_ft.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBd8"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_ft.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Cjk_m_str_ft.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_ft.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Cjk_m_str_ft.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_ft.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBeA"/></a></span>, <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBeE"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_wd.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBeI"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_wd.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Cjk_m_str_wd.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_wd.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Cjk_m_str_wd.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_wd.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBeM"/></a></span>, <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBeQ"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_rsv.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBeU"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_rsv.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Cjk_m_str_rsv.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_rsv.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Cjk_m_str_rsv.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_rsv.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBeY"/></a></span>, <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBec"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_thtaj.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBeg"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_thtaj.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Cjk_m_str_thtaj.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_thtaj.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Cjk_m_str_thtaj.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_thtaj.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBek"/></a></span>, <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBeo"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_vcj.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBes"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_vcj.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Cjk_m_str_vcj.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_vcj.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Cjk_m_str_vcj.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_vcj.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBew"/></a></span>, etc.</p>

<p id="mwBe0">In Simplified Chinese, stroke TN <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBe4"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_hp.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBe8"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_hp.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Cjk_m_str_hp.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_hp.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Cjk_m_str_hp.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_hp.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBfA"/></a></span> is usually written as <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBfE"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_hp-prc.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBfI"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Cjk_m_str_hp-prc.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Cjk_m_str_hp-prc.svg/40px-Cjk_m_str_hp-prc.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Cjk_m_str_hp-prc.svg/60px-Cjk_m_str_hp-prc.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBfM"/></a></span> (It was called "stroke DN", but Unicode has rejected it<sup about="#mwt162" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-IRGN1174_9-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"IRGN1174"}}'><a href="#cite_note-IRGN1174-9" id="mwBfQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBfU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBfY">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBfc">]</span></span></a></sup>).</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwBfg" aria-labelledby="English_abbreviated_naming_conventions"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="English_abbreviated_naming_conventions">English abbreviated naming conventions</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: English abbreviated naming conventions"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBfk">There is another naming convention that use abbreviated forms of the English names for CJK strokes. The first letter of the English names are used in the naming system. The controlled vocabulary can be divided into two groups.<sup about="#mwt165" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ichiten-strokes_12-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ichiten-strokes"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-ichiten-strokes-12"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ichiten-strokes-12" id="mwBfo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBfs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBfw">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBf0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwBf4">The first group is the abbreviated forms of the basic strokes.</p>

<table class="wikitable" style="text-align:center;" id="mwBf8">
<caption id="mwBgA"><b id="mwBgE"> Abbreviation form of the basic strokes (10 items)</b></caption>
<tbody id="mwBgI"><tr id="mwBgM">
<th id="mwBgQ">Abbr form</th><th id="mwBgU">H</th><th id="mwBgY">V</th><th id="mwBgc">T</th><th id="mwBgg">P</th><th id="mwBgk">D</th><th id="mwBgo">U</th><th id="mwBgs">C</th><th id="mwBgw">A</th><th id="mwBg0">J</th><th id="mwBg4">O</th></tr>
<tr id="mwBg8">
<th id="mwBhA">Shape of stroke</th>
<td id="mwBhE"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBhI"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_h.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBhM"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_h.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Basic_h.png/60px-Basic_h.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Basic_h.png/120px-Basic_h.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBhQ"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBhU"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBhY"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_v.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBhc"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_v.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Basic_v.png/60px-Basic_v.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Basic_v.png/120px-Basic_v.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBhg"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBhk"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBho"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_t.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBhs"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_t.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Basic_t.png/60px-Basic_t.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Basic_t.png/120px-Basic_t.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBhw"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBh0"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBh4"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_p.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBh8"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_p.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Basic_p.png/60px-Basic_p.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Basic_p.png/120px-Basic_p.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBiA"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBiE"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBiI"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_d.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBiM"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_d.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Basic_d.png/60px-Basic_d.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Basic_d.png/120px-Basic_d.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBiQ"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBiU"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBiY"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_u.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBic"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_u.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Basic_u.png/60px-Basic_u.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Basic_u.png/120px-Basic_u.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBig"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBik"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBio"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_c.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBis"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_c.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Basic_c.png/60px-Basic_c.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Basic_c.png/120px-Basic_c.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBiw"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBi0"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBi4"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_a.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBi8"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_a.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Basic_a.png/60px-Basic_a.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Basic_a.png/120px-Basic_a.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBjA"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBjE"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBjI"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_j.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBjM"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_j.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Basic_j.png/60px-Basic_j.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Basic_j.png/120px-Basic_j.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBjQ"/></a></span></td><td id="mwBjU"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBjY"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_o.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBjc"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Basic_o.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Basic_o.png/60px-Basic_o.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Basic_o.png/120px-Basic_o.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="45" width="45" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBjg"/></a></span></td></tr>
<tr id="mwBjk">
<th id="mwBjo">English name</th>
<td id="mwBjs"><b id="mwBjw">H</b>orizontal</td><td id="mwBj0"><b id="mwBj4">V</b>ertical</td><td id="mwBj8"><b id="mwBkA">T</b>hrow</td><td id="mwBkE"><b id="mwBkI">P</b>ress</td><td id="mwBkM"><b id="mwBkQ">D</b>ot</td><td id="mwBkU"><b id="mwBkY">U</b>pward<br id="mwBkc"/>horizontal</td><td id="mwBkg"><b id="mwBkk">C</b>lockwise<br id="mwBko"/>curve</td><td id="mwBks"><b id="mwBkw">A</b>nticlockwise<br id="mwBk0"/>curve</td><td id="mwBk4"><b id="mwBk8">J</b> hook</td><td id="mwBlA"><b id="mwBlE">O</b>val</td></tr>
<tr id="mwBlI">
<th id="mwBlM">Chinese name</th>
<td id="mwBlQ">橫</td><td id="mwBlU">豎</td><td id="mwBlY">撇</td><td id="mwBlc">捺</td><td id="mwBlg">點</td><td id="mwBlk">挑</td><td id="mwBlo">彎</td><td id="mwBls">曲</td><td id="mwBlw">鈎</td><td id="mwBl0">圈</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwBl4">The second group is the abbreviated forms of deformations used to form compound strokes.</p>

<table class="wikitable" style="text-align:center;" id="mwBl8">
<caption id="mwBmA"><b id="mwBmE"> Abbreviation form of the deformations (10 items)</b></caption>
<tbody id="mwBmI"><tr id="mwBmM">
<th id="mwBmQ">Abbr form</th><th id="mwBmU">F</th><th id="mwBmY">W</th><th id="mwBmc">S</th><th id="mwBmg">L</th><th id="mwBmk">R</th><th id="mwBmo">E</th><th id="mwBms">N</th><th id="mwBmw">I</th><th id="mwBm0">M</th><th id="mwBm4">Z</th></tr>
<tr id="mwBm8">
<th id="mwBnA">Deformation</th>
