<tr>
<td colspan="17" style="background:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#f8f9fa);color:inherit;font-size:small;text-align:left"><b>Notes</b>
<dl><dd>1.<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt368" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"}}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_U31C0_as_of_Unicode_version"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_U31C0_as_of_Unicode_version" class="mw-selflink-fragment">^</a></b></span>As of Unicode version 18.0</dd>
<dd>2.<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt369" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"}}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_U31C0_grey"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_U31C0_grey" class="mw-selflink-fragment">^</a></b></span>Grey areas indicate non-assigned code points</dd></dl></td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwDbo">A stroke table is also called a stroke alphabet, whose function in the Chinese writing system is akin to the Latin alphabet for the English writing system.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="20" id="mwDbs" aria-labelledby="YES_strokes"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="YES_strokes">YES strokes</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20" title="Edit section: YES strokes"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwDbw">Another stroke table is the YES Stroke Alphabet, which is used in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YES_stroke_alphabetical_order" title="YES stroke alphabetical order" id="mwDb0">YES stroke alphabetical order</a>.<sup about="#mwt370" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEZhang2013_29-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEZhang2013"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEZhang2013-29"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Zhang"},"2":{"wt":"2013"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEZhang2013-29" id="mwDb4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDb8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDcA">[</span>26<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDcE">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt373" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-30" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-30"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Arial,Calibri,Comic Sans,Courier New,EB Garamond,Georgia,Helvetica,Impact,Montserrat,Nunito,Palatino,Roboto,Segoe UI,Tahoma,Times NEW Roman,Trebuchet,Verdana pushes,, Cambria not pushes"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-30" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwDcI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDcM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDcQ">[</span>a<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDcU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="21" id="mwDcY" aria-labelledby="Stroke_alphabet"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Stroke_alphabet">Stroke alphabet</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21" title="Edit section: Stroke alphabet"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwDcc">This is a list of 30 strokes:</p>

<p id="mwDcg"><span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt376" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDck" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇐ ㇕ ㇅ ㇎ ㇡ ㇋ ㇊ ㇍ ㇈ 乙 ㇆ ㇇ ㇌ ⺄ ㇀ ㇑ ㇗ ㇞ ㇉ ㄣ ㇙ ㇄ ㇟ ㇚ ㇓ ㇜ ㇛ ㇃ ㇔ ㇏ ㇂"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇐ ㇕ ㇅ ㇎ ㇡ ㇋ ㇊ ㇍ ㇈ 乙 ㇆ ㇇ ㇌ ⺄ ㇀ ㇑ ㇗ ㇞ ㇉ ㄣ ㇙ ㇄ ㇟ ㇚ ㇓ ㇜ ㇛ ㇃ ㇔ ㇏ ㇂</span></p>

<p id="mwDco">The stroke alphabet is built on the basis of <i id="mwDcs">Unicode CJK Strokes</i><sup about="#mwt379" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-CJK_Strokes_31-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"CJK Strokes"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-CJK_Strokes-31"}}'><a href="#cite_note-CJK_Strokes-31" id="mwDcw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDc0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDc4">[</span>27<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDc8">]</span></span></a></sup>
and the <i id="mwDdA">Standard of Chinese Character Bending Strokes of the GB13000.1 Character Set</i>.<sup about="#mwt380" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEPRC2002_32-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEPRC2002"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEPRC2002-32"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"PRC"},"2":{"wt":"2002"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEPRC2002-32" id="mwDdE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDdI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDdM">[</span>28<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDdQ">]</span></span></a></sup> There are totally 30 strokes, sorted by the standard plane strokes order of <i id="mwDdU">heng</i> (<span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt383" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDdY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"橫"},"s":{"wt":"横"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>横</span><span about="#mwt383">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt383" id="mwDdc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>橫</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt384" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDdg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"一"}},"i":0}}]}'>一</span>), <i id="mwDdk">tiao, ti</i> (<span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt385" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDdo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"挑"},"s":{"wt":"提"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>提</span><span about="#mwt385">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt385" id="mwDds"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>挑</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt386" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDdw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇀"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇀</span>), <i id="mwDd0">shu</i> (<span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt387" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDd4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"豎"},"1":{"wt":"s竖"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>豎</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt388" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDd8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丨"}},"i":0}}]}'>丨</span>), <i id="mwDeA">pie</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt389" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDeE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"撇"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>撇</span>,  <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt390" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDeI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丿"}},"i":0}}]}'>丿</span>), <i id="mwDeM">dian</i> (<span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt391" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDeQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"點"},"s":{"wt":"点"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>点</span><span about="#mwt391">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt391" id="mwDeU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>點</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt392" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDeY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丶"}},"i":0}}]}'>丶</span>), <i id="mwDec">na</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt393" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDeg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"捺"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>捺</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt394" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDek" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇏"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇏</span>) and the bending points order of <i id="mwDeo">zhe</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt395" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDes" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"折"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>折</span>), <i id="mwDew">wan</i> (<span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt396" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDe0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"彎"},"s":{"wt":"弯"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>弯</span><span about="#mwt396">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt396" id="mwDe4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>彎</span>) and <i id="mwDe8">gou</i> (<span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt397" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDfA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"鉤"},"s":{"wt":"钩"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>钩</span><span about="#mwt397">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt397" id="mwDfE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>鉤</span>).<sup about="#mwt398" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEZhang20135–6_33-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEZhang20135–6"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEZhang20135–6-33"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Zhang"},"2":{"wt":"2013"},"pp":{"wt":"5-6"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEZhang20135–6-33" id="mwDfI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDfM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDfQ">[</span>29<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDfU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="22" id="mwDfY" aria-labelledby="Names"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Names">Names</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22" title="Edit section: Names"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwDfc">The English name is formed by the initial <i id="mwDfg">Pinyin letters</i> of each character in the Chinese name, similar to the naming of CJK strokes in Unicode,<sup about="#mwt401" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-CJK_Strokes_31-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"CJK Strokes"}}'><a href="#cite_note-CJK_Strokes-31" id="mwDfk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDfo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDfs">[</span>27<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDfw">]</span></span></a></sup> (i.e., H: <i id="mwDf0">heng</i>, T: <i id="mwDf4">ti/tiao</i>, S: <i id="mwDf8">shu</i>, P: <i id="mwDgA">pie</i>, D: <i id="mwDgE">dian</i>, N: <i id="mwDgI">na</i>; z: <i id="mwDgM">zhe</i>, w: <i id="mwDgQ">wan</i> and g: <i id="mwDgU">gou</i>).</p>
<table class="wikitable" id="mwDgY">
<caption id="mwDgc">YES stroke names</caption>
<tbody id="mwDgg"><tr id="mwDgk">
<th id="mwDgo">Stroke</th>
