<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt502" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDyk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"notelist","href":"./Template:Notelist"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1327269900" about="#mwt503" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Reflist/styles.css"}}'/></span><div about="#mwt502" id="mwDyo">
<div class="mw-references-wrap" typeof="mw:Extension/references" about="#mwt504" id="mwDys" data-mw='{"name":"references","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha","responsive":"1"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'><ol class="mw-references references" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwDyw"><li about="#cite_note-30" id="cite_note-30" data-mw-footnote-number="a"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwDy0"><a href="#cite_ref-30" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwDy4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwDy8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-30" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha">Arial,Calibri,Comic Sans,Courier New,EB Garamond,Georgia,Helvetica,Impact,Montserrat,Nunito,Palatino,Roboto,Segoe UI,Tahoma,Times NEW Roman,Trebuchet,Verdana pushes,, Cambria not pushes</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-34" id="cite_note-34" data-mw-footnote-number="b"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwDzA"><a href="#cite_ref-34" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwDzE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwDzI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-34" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha"> according to the stroke orders in <i id="mwDzM">Standard of GB13000.1 Character Set Chinese Character Order</i> (Stroke-Based Order)<sup about="#mwt403" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999_22-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission1999"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999-22"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999-22" id="mwDzQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDzU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDzY">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDzc">]</span></span></a></sup></span></li>
</ol></div></div>
<p id="mwDzg">For more on stroke forms, stroke naming and stroke tables, please visit the previous sections.</p>

</section></section></section><section data-mw-section-id="23" id="mwDzk" aria-labelledby="Stroke_order"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Stroke_order">Stroke order</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23" title="Edit section: Stroke order"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt505" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDzo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Stroke order"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt506" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt505" id="mwDzs">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke_order" title="Stroke order">Stroke order</a></div>
<p id="mwDzw">The term <i id="mwDz0">stroke order</i> can refer to one of two concepts:</p>
<ul id="mwDz4"><li id="mwDz8">The direction in which a stroke is written—for example, the <i id="mwD0A">heng</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt507" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD0E" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"㇐"},"l":{"wt":"horizontal"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>㇐</span><span about="#mwt507">; </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt507">'</span><span about="#mwt507">horizontal</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt507">'</span>) stroke is made horizontally from left to right, while the <i id="mwD0I">shu</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt508" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD0M" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"㇑"},"l":{"wt":"vertical"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>㇑</span><span about="#mwt508">; </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt508">'</span><span about="#mwt508">vertical</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt508">'</span>) stroke is written vertically from top to bottom.</li>
<li id="mwD0Q">The order in which strokes are written one by one to form a Chinese character.</li></ul>
<p id="mwD0U">Because the direction of strokes is relatively simple, people generally refer to the latter meaning when talking about stroke order.</p>

<p id="mwD0Y">Certain <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke_order#General_guidelines" title="Stroke order" id="mwD0c">stroke orders guidelines</a> are recommended to ensure speed, accuracy, and legibility in composition, as most <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_characters" title="Chinese characters" id="mwD0g">Chinese characters</a> have many strokes.  As such, teachers enforce exactly one stroke order for each character, marking every deviation as a mistake, so everyone writes these characters the same way.<link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_with_unsourced_statements" about="#mwt509" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD0k" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Citation needed","href":"./Template:Citation_needed"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"June 2022"}},"i":0}}]}'/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_unsourced_statements_from_June_2022" about="#mwt509"/><sup class="noprint Inline-Template Template-Fact" style="white-space:nowrap;" about="#mwt509" id="mwD0o"><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Citation_needed" title="Wikipedia:Citation needed"><span title="This claim needs references to reliable sources. (June 2022)">citation needed</span></a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></sup> The stroke order follows a few simple rules, though, which aids in memorizing these. To write <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CJK_characters" title="CJK characters" id="mwD0s">CJK characters</a>, one must know how to write CJK strokes, and thus, needs to identify the basic strokes that make up a character.</p>

<p id="mwD0w">The most basic rules of stroke order are:</p>
<ol id="mwD00"><li id="mwD04"><i id="mwD08">Heng</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt510" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD1A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇐"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇐</span>), then <i id="mwD1E">shu</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt511" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD1I" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇑"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇑</span>)
<ul id="mwD1M"><li id="mwD1Q">Examples: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt512" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD1U" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"十"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>十</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt513" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD1Y" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"卄"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>卄</span></li></ul></li>
<li id="mwD1c"><i id="mwD1g">Pie</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt514" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD1k" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丿"}},"i":0}}]}'>丿</span>), then <i id="mwD1o">na</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt515" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD1s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇏"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇏</span>)
<ul id="mwD1w"><li id="mwD10">Examples: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt516" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD14" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"乂"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>乂</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt517" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD18" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"文"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>文</span></li></ul></li>
<li id="mwD2A">Up, then down
<ul id="mwD2E"><li id="mwD2I">Examples: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt518" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD2M" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"三"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>三</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt519" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD2Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"旦"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>旦</span></li></ul></li>
<li id="mwD2U">Left, then right
<ul id="mwD2Y"><li id="mwD2c">Examples: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt520" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD2g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"川"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>川</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt521" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD2k" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"好"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>好</span></li></ul></li>
<li id="mwD2o">Outside, then inside
<ul id="mwD2s"><li id="mwD2w">Examples: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt522" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD20" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"同"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>同</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt523" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD24" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"廣"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>廣</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt524" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD28" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"司"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>司</span></li></ul></li></ol>

<p id="mwD3A">The stroke orders of <span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt525" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD3E" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"筆"},"s":{"wt":"笔"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>笔</span><span about="#mwt525">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt525" id="mwD3I"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>筆</span> and <span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt526" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD3M" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"t":{"wt":"順"},"s":{"wt":"顺"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>顺</span><span about="#mwt526">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt526" id="mwD3Q"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>順</span> are</p>
<dl id="mwD3U"><dd id="mwD3Y"><span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt527" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD3c" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"筆：㇓㇐㇔㇓㇐㇔㇕㇐㇐㇐㇐㇑"}},"i":0}}]}'>筆：㇓㇐㇔㇓㇐㇔㇕㇐㇐㇐㇐㇑</span></dd>
<dd id="mwD3g"><span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt528" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD3k" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"笔：㇓㇐㇔㇓㇐㇔㇓㇐㇐㇟"}},"i":0}}]}'>笔：㇓㇐㇔㇓㇐㇔㇓㇐㇐㇟</span></dd>
<dd id="mwD3o"><span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt529" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD3s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"順：㇓㇑㇑㇐㇓㇑㇕㇐㇐㇐㇓㇔"}},"i":0}}]}'>順：㇓㇑㇑㇐㇓㇑㇕㇐㇐㇐㇓㇔</span></dd>
<dd id="mwD3w"><span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt530" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD30" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"顺：㇓㇑㇑㇐㇓㇑㇕㇓㇔"}},"i":0}}]}'>顺：㇓㇑㇑㇐㇓㇑㇕㇓㇔</span></dd></dl>

<p id="mwD34">The order of strokes is a summary of people's experience in writing Chinese characters correctly and conveniently.
It plays an important role in the teaching, sorting and computer information processing of Chinese characters.
The stroke order of cursive script (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt531" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD38" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"草書"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>草書</span>) is quite flexible and changeable, so the standard of stroke order generally refers to the stroke order of regular script (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt532" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD4A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"楷書"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>楷書</span>).</p>

<p id="mwD4E">The current stroke order standards are</p>
<ul id="mwD4I"><li id="mwD4M">China's <i id="mwD4Q">Stroke Orders of the Commonly-used Standard Chinese Characters</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt533" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD4U" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"通用规范汉字笔顺规范"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>通用规范汉字笔顺规范</span><sup about="#mwt534" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEPRC2021_15-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEPRC2021"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEPRC2021-15"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"PRC"},"2":{"wt":"2021"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEPRC2021-15" id="mwD4Y"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwD4c"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD4g">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD4k">]</span></span></a></sup>), and</li>
<li id="mwD4o">Taiwan's <i id="mwD4s">Handbook of the Stroke Orders of the Commonly-used National Chinese Characters</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt537" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD4w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"常用國字標準字體筆順手册"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>常用國字標準字體筆順手册</span><sup about="#mwt538" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTETaiwan1996_16-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTETaiwan1996"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTETaiwan1996-16"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Taiwan"},"2":{"wt":"1996"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTETaiwan1996-16" id="mwD40"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwD44"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD48">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD5A">]</span></span></a></sup>).</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="24" id="mwD5E" aria-labelledby="Character_sorting"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Character_sorting">Character sorting</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=24" title="Edit section: Character sorting"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt541" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD5I" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Stroke-based sorting"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt542" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt541" id="mwD5M">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke-based_sorting" title="Stroke-based sorting">Stroke-based sorting</a></div>

<p id="mwD5Q">Chinese characters can be sorted into different orders by their strokes. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke-based_sorting" title="Stroke-based sorting" id="mwD5U">Stroke-based sorting</a> methods include Stroke-count sorting, Stroke-order sorting, Stroke-count-stroke-order sorting, and YES sorting.</p>

<section data-mw-section-id="25" id="mwD5Y" aria-labelledby="Stroke-count_sorting"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Stroke-count_sorting">Stroke-count sorting</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=25" title="Edit section: Stroke-count sorting"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwD5c">Characters may be sorted by their number of strokes. For example, the different characters in <span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt543" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD5g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"汉字笔画"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>汉字笔画</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt544" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD5k" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"漢字筆劃"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>漢字筆劃</span> are sorted into:</p>
<ul id="mwD5o"><li id="mwD5s"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt545" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD5w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"汉"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>汉</span> (5)</li>
<li id="mwD50"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt546" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD54" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"字"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>字</span> (6)</li>
<li id="mwD58"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt547" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD6A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"画"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>画</span> (8)</li>
<li id="mwD6E"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt548" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD6I" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"笔"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>笔</span> (10)</li>
<li id="mwD6M"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt549" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD6Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"筆"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>筆</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt550" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD6U" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"畫"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>畫</span> (12)</li>
<li id="mwD6Y"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt551" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD6c" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"漢"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>漢</span> (14)</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="26" id="mwD6g" aria-labelledby="Stroke-order_sorting"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Stroke-order_sorting">Stroke-order sorting</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=26" title="Edit section: Stroke-order sorting"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwD6k">The characters are firstly arranged by their first strokes according to an order of stroke groups—such as</p>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt552" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD6o" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"holist","href":"./Template:Holist"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;heng&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=横}})"},"2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;shu&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=竖}})"},"3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;pie&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=撇}})"},"4":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;dian&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=点}})"},"5":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;zhe&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=折}})"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1374427404" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt553" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Hlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist .mw-empty-li{display:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt::after{content:": "}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li::after{content:"\a0 · ";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li li:first-child::before{content:" (";font-weight:normal}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li li:last-child::after{content:")";font-weight:normal}.mw-parser-output .hlist ol{counter-reset:listitem}.mw-parser-output .hlist ol>li{counter-increment:listitem}.mw-parser-output .hlist ol>li::before{content:" "counter(listitem)"\a0 "}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd ol>li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt ol>li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li ol>li:first-child::before{content:" ("counter(listitem)"\a0 "}</style></span><div class="hlist" about="#mwt552" id="mwD6s"><ol><li><i>heng</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>横</span>)</li><li><i>shu</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>竖</span>)</li><li><i>pie</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>撇</span>)</li><li><i>dian</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>点</span>)</li><li><i>zhe</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>折</span>)</li></ol></div><p id="mwD6w"> or</p>

<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt554" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD60" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"holist","href":"./Template:Holist"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;dian&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=点}})"},"2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;heng&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=横}})"},"3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;shu&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=竖}})"},"4":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;pie&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=撇}})"},"5":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;zhe&apos;&apos; ({{zhi|c=折}})"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1374427404" about="#mwt555" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Hlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div class="hlist" about="#mwt554" id="mwD64"><ol><li><i>dian</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>点</span>)</li><li><i>heng</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>横</span>)</li><li><i>shu</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>竖</span>)</li><li><i>pie</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>撇</span>)</li><li><i>zhe</i> (<span lang="zh"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>折</span>)</li></ol></div>

<p id="mwD68">then the characters with first strokes belonging to the same group, if any, are sorted by their second strokes in a similar way, and so on. This method is usually employed to support stroke-count sorting to deal with characters of the same <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke_number" title="Stroke number" id="mwD7A">stroke number</a>. For instance, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt556" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7E" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"筆"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>筆</span> (12) starts with stroke <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt557" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7I" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇓"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇓</span> of the <i id="mwD7M">pie</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt558" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"撇"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>撇</span>) group, and  <span lang="zh" about="#mwt559" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7U" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"畫"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>畫</span> (12) starts with <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt560" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7Y" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇕"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇕</span> of the <i id="mwD7c">zhe</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt561" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"折"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>折</span>) group, and <i id="mwD7k">pie</i> is before <i id="mwD7o">zhe</i> in groups order, so <span lang="zh" about="#mwt562" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"筆"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>筆</span> goes before <span lang="zh" about="#mwt563" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD7w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"畫"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>畫</span>.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="27" id="mwD70" aria-labelledby="Stroke–count–stroke–order_sorting"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Stroke–count–stroke–order_sorting"><span id="Stroke.E2.80.93count.E2.80.93stroke.E2.80.93order_sorting" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>Stroke–count–stroke–order sorting</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=27" title="Edit section: Stroke–count–stroke–order sorting"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwD74">This is a combination of the previous two methods. In China, stroke-based sorting normally refers to stroke–count–stroke–order sorting. The Chinese national standard stroke-based sorting is in fact an enhanced stroke-count-stroke-order method<sup about="#mwt568" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-35" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-35"}}'><a href="#cite_note-35" id="mwD78"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwD8A"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD8E">[</span>30<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD8I">]</span></span></a></sup> Characters are arranged by stroke count, followed by stroke order. For example, the different characters in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt564" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD8M" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"汉字笔画"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>汉字笔画</span>、<span lang="zh" about="#mwt565" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD8Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"漢字筆劃"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>漢字筆劃</span> are sorted into</p>
<ul id="mwD8U"><li id="mwD8Y"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt569" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD8c" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"汉"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>汉</span> (5)</li>
<li id="mwD8g"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt570" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD8k" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"字"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>字</span> (6)</li>
<li id="mwD8o"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt571" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD8s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"画"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>画</span> (8)</li>
<li id="mwD8w"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt572" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD80" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"笔"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>笔</span> (10)</li>
<li id="mwD84"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt573" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD88" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"筆"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>筆</span> (12)</li>
<li id="mwD9A"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt574" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD9E" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"畫"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>畫</span> (12)</li>
<li id="mwD9I"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt575" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD9M" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"漢"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>漢</span> (14)</li></ul>
<p id="mwD9Q">where each character is put at a unique position.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="28" id="mwD9U" aria-labelledby="YES_sorting"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="YES_sorting">YES sorting</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=28" title="Edit section: YES sorting"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt576" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD9Y" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"YES sorting"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt577" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt576" id="mwD9c">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YES_sorting" title="YES sorting" class="mw-redirect">YES sorting</a></div>
<p id="mwD9g">YES is a simplified stroke-based sorting method free of stroke counting and grouping, but without comprising accuracy. It has been used successfully to index the characters in the <i id="mwD9k"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xinhua_Zidian" title="Xinhua Zidian" class="mw-redirect" id="mwD9o">Xinhua Zidian</a></i> and <i id="mwD9s"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiandai_Hanyu_Cidian" title="Xiandai Hanyu Cidian" id="mwD9w">Xiandai Hanyu Cidian</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt580" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-36" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-36"}}'><a href="#cite_note-36" id="mwD90"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwD94"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD98">[</span>31<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD-A">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="29" id="mwD-E" aria-labelledby="Stroke_combination"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Stroke_combination">Stroke combination</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=29" title="Edit section: Stroke combination"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<p id="mwD-I">There are three types of combinations between two strokes (<span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt581" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD-M" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"p":{"wt":"bǐhuà zǔhé"},"t":{"wt":"筆劃組合"},"s":{"wt":"笔划组合"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>笔划组合</span><span about="#mwt581">; </span><span lang="zh-Hant" about="#mwt581"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_traditional_Chinese-language_text"/>筆劃組合</span><span about="#mwt581">; </span><i about="#mwt581" id="mwD-Q"><span lang="zh-Latn">bǐhuà zǔhé</span></i>):<sup about="#mwt582" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201482_37-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201482"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201482-37"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"p":{"wt":"82"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201482-37" id="mwD-U"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwD-Y"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD-c">[</span>32<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwD-g">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ol id="mwD-k"><li id="mwD-o">Separation: the strokes are separated from each other. Such as: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt585" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD-s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"八, 三, 小"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八, 三, 小</span>.</li>
<li id="mwD-w">Connection: the strokes are connected, this type can be further divided into two categories:
<ol id="mwD-0"><li id="mwD-4">The end point of one stroke is connected with the body of another stroke
<ol id="mwD-8"><li id="mwD_A">An end of the first stroke is connected to the following stroke's body, such as <span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt586" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_E" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"匕"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>匕</span> (stroke order: <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt587" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_I" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇓㇟"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇓㇟</span>),</li>
<li id="mwD_M">The body of the first stroke is connected to an end of the following stroke, such as: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt588" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"人"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>人</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt589" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_U" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇓㇏"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇓㇏</span>).</li></ol></li>
<li id="mwD_Y">Two strokes are connected end to end, including 
<ol id="mwD_c"><li id="mwD_g">head-to-head (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt590" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_k" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"首首"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>首首</span>), such as <span lang="zh" about="#mwt591" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_o" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"厂"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>厂</span> (stroke order: <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt592" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_s" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇐㇓"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇐㇓</span>),</li>
<li id="mwD_w">tail-to-tail (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt593" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"尾尾"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>尾尾</span>), such as the first two strokes of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt594" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"弓"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>弓</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt595" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwD_8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇕㇐㇉"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇕㇐㇉</span>),</li>
<li id="mwEAA">tail-to-head (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt596" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEAE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"尾首"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>尾首</span>), such as <span lang="zh" about="#mwt597" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEAI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"了"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>了</span> (㇇㇚). Another example: in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt598" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEAM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"口"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>口</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt599" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEAQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇑㇕㇐"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇑㇕㇐</span>), the first two strokes are connected head-to-head, the second two tail-to-tail, and the last stroke is connected to the first stroke head-to-tail.</li></ol></li></ol></li>
<li id="mwEAU">Intersection: the strokes are intersected. Such as: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt600" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEAY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"十丈車"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>十丈車</span>.</li></ol>
<p id="mwEAc">In a Chinese character, multiple stroke combinations are usually used together. Such as: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt601" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEAg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"港"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>港</span>.</p>

<p id="mwEAk">The same strokes and stroke order may form different Chinese characters or character components due to different combinations. For example:<sup about="#mwt602" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201482_37-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201482"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201482-37"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"p":{"wt":"82"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201482-37" id="mwEAo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEAs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEAw">[</span>32<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEA0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ul id="mwEA4"><li id="mwEA8"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt605" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"刀力"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>刀力</span> (stroke order: <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt606" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇆㇓"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇆㇓</span>),</li>
<li id="mwEBI"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt607" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"由田"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>由田</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt608" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇑㇕㇐㇑㇐"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇑㇕㇐㇑㇐</span>),</li>
<li id="mwEBU"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt609" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"工土士"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>工土士</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt610" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇐㇑㇐"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇐㇑㇐</span>),</li>
<li id="mwEBg"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt611" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"八人入乂"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八人入乂</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt612" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇓㇏)"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇓㇏)</span>,</li>
<li id="mwEBs"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt613" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"甲曱申叶"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>甲曱申叶</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt614" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEB0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇑㇕㇐㇐㇑"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇑㇕㇐㇐㇑</span>),</li>
<li id="mwEB4"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt615" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEB8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"己已巳"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>己已巳</span> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt616" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwECA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇕㇐㇟"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇕㇐㇟</span>).</li></ul>

<p id="mwECE">Stroke combinations can function to distinguish Chinese characters.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="30" id="mwECI" aria-labelledby="Distribution"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Distribution">Distribution</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=30" title="Edit section: Distribution"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwECM">The following tables present some experimental results on the distribution of Chinese character strokes in several dictionaries and character sets. The strokes are summarized in the five categories of <i id="mwECQ">heng</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt617" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwECU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"横"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>横</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt618" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwECY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"一"}},"i":0}}]}'>一</span> 'horizontal'), <i id="mwECc">shu</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt619" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwECg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"竖"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>竖</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt620" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwECk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丨"}},"i":0}}]}'>丨</span> 'vertical'), <i id="mwECo">pie</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt621" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwECs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"撇"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>撇</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt622" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwECw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丿"}},"i":0}}]}'>丿</span> 'left-falling'), <i id="mwEC0">dian</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt623" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEC4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"点"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>点</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt624" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEC8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丶"}},"i":0}}]}'>丶</span> 'dot') and <i id="mwEDA">zhe</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt625" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEDE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"折"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>折</span>, <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt626" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEDI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"𠃍"}},"i":0}}]}'>𠃍</span> 'bent').</p>

<section data-mw-section-id="31" id="mwEDM" aria-labelledby="Frequency"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Frequency">Frequency</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=31" title="Edit section: Frequency"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<table class="wikitable" id="mwEDQ">
<caption id="mwEDU">Frequency of strokes in the <i id="mwEDY">Cihai</i></caption>
<tbody id="mwEDc"><tr id="mwEDg">
<th id="mwEDk">Stroke type</th>
<th id="mwEDo">Characters</th>
<th id="mwEDs">Appearances</th>
<th id="mwEDw">Frequency (%)</th></tr>
<tr id="mwED0">
<td id="mwED4"><i id="mwED8">heng</i></td>
<td id="mwEEA">15,830</td>
<td id="mwEEE">63,658</td>
<td id="mwEEI">30.6638%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEEM">
<td id="mwEEQ"><i id="mwEEU">shu</i></td>
<td id="mwEEY">14,997</td>
<td id="mwEEc">39,811</td>
<td id="mwEEg">19.1761%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEEk">
<td id="mwEEo"><i id="mwEEs">zhe</i></td>
<td id="mwEEw">15,222</td>
<td id="mwEE0">36505</td>
<td id="mwEE4">17.5845%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEE8">
<td id="mwEFA"><i id="mwEFE">dian</i></td>
<td id="mwEFI">13,832</td>
<td id="mwEFM">36,346</td>
<td id="mwEFQ">17.5076%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEFU">
<td id="mwEFY"><i id="mwEFc">pie</i></td>
<td id="mwEFg">14,202</td>
<td id="mwEFk">31,285</td>
<td id="mwEFo">15.0695%</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwEFs">where field Characters includes the numbers of characters containing the strokes of each type, and field Appearances includes the number of appearances of the strokes in each type. The data is from an experiment on the 16,339 traditional and simplified Chinese characters in the <i id="mwEFw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cihai" title="Cihai" id="mwEF0">Cihai</a></i> (1979 edition), sorted in descending order of frequencies of appearance.<sup about="#mwt627" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEFu199915_38-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEFu199915"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199915-38"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Fu"},"2":{"wt":"1999"},"p":{"wt":"15"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199915-38" id="mwEF4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEF8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEGA">[</span>33<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEGE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<table class="wikitable" id="mwEGI">
<caption id="mwEGM">Frequencies of strokes in the Unicode CJK Chinese character set<sup about="#mwt630" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-unicode.org_21-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"unicode.org"}}'><a href="#cite_note-unicode.org-21" id="mwEGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEGU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEGY">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEGc">]</span></span></a></sup></caption>
<tbody id="mwEGg"><tr id="mwEGk">
<th id="mwEGo">Stroke type</th>
<th id="mwEGs">Characters</th>
<th id="mwEGw">Appearances</th>
<th id="mwEG0">Frequency (%)</th></tr>
<tr id="mwEG4">
<td id="mwEG8"><i id="mwEHA">heng</i></td>
<td id="mwEHE">20,219</td>
<td id="mwEHI">82,712</td>
<td id="mwEHM">30.808%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEHQ">
<td id="mwEHU"><i id="mwEHY">shu</i></td>
<td id="mwEHc">19,302</td>
<td id="mwEHg">51,460</td>
<td id="mwEHk">19.167%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEHo">
<td id="mwEHs"><i id="mwEHw">dian</i></td>
<td id="mwEH0">17,754</td>
<td id="mwEH4">48,089</td>
<td id="mwEH8">17.912%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEIA">
<td id="mwEIE"><i id="mwEII">zhe</i></td>
<td id="mwEIM">19,310</td>
<td id="mwEIQ">45,279</td>
<td id="mwEIU">16.865%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEIY">
<td id="mwEIc"><i id="mwEIg">pie</i></td>
<td id="mwEIk">18,295</td>
<td id="mwEIo">40,940</td>
<td id="mwEIs">15.249%</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwEIw">The data is from an experiment on the 20,902 traditional and simplified Chinese characters in the GB13000.1 character set—equivalent to the Unicode BMP CJK Chinese character set—sorted in descending order of frequencies of appearance.<sup about="#mwt631" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999_22-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission1999"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999-22"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission "},"2":{"wt":"1999"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999-22" id="mwEI0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEI4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEI8">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEJA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt634" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_18-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":0"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:0-18" id="mwEJE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEJI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEJM">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEJQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwEJU">The statistical results above made by different people on different character sets are basically consistent:
The most commonly used stroke is <i id="mwEJY">heng</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt635" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEJc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇐"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇐</span>), followed by <i id="mwEJg">shu</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt636" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEJk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇑"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇑</span>). The least used is <i id="mwEJo">pie</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt637" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEJs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇓"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇓</span>).
The orders of <i id="mwEJw">dian</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt638" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEJ0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇔"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇔</span>) and <i id="mwEJ4">zhe</i> (<span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt639" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEJ8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇕"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇕</span>) are different, though their frequencies are close.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="32" id="mwEKA" aria-labelledby="Initial_and_final_strokes_of_characters"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Initial_and_final_strokes_of_characters">Initial and final strokes of characters</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=32" title="Edit section: Initial and final strokes of characters"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<table class="wikitable" id="mwEKE">
<caption id="mwEKI"><i id="mwEKM">Chinese Character Information Dictionary</i> initial and final strokes for characters<sup about="#mwt640" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTELi1988998_39-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTELi1988998"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTELi1988998-39"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Li"},"2":{"wt":"1988"},"p":{"wt":"998"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTELi1988998-39" id="mwEKQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEKU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEKY">[</span>34<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEKc">]</span></span></a></sup></caption>
<tbody id="mwEKg"><tr id="mwEKk">
<th id="mwEKo">Stroke type</th>
<th id="mwEKs">Characters started</th>
<th id="mwEKw">Frequency (%)</th>
<th id="mwEK0">Characters ended</th>
<th id="mwEK4">Frequency (%)</th></tr>
<tr id="mwEK8">
<td id="mwELA"><i id="mwELE">heng</i></td>
<td id="mwELI">2322</td>
<td id="mwELM">29.827%</td>
<td id="mwELQ">2288</td>
<td id="mwELU">29.390%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwELY">
<td id="mwELc"><i id="mwELg">pie</i></td>
<td id="mwELk">1767</td>
<td id="mwELo">22.697%</td>
<td id="mwELs">360</td>
<td id="mwELw">4.624%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEL0">
<td id="mwEL4"><i id="mwEL8">dian</i></td>
<td id="mwEMA">1729</td>
<td id="mwEME">22.209%</td>
<td id="mwEMI">3115</td>
<td id="mwEMM">40.012%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEMQ">
<td id="mwEMU"><i id="mwEMY">shu</i></td>
<td id="mwEMc">1247</td>
<td id="mwEMg">16.017%</td>
<td id="mwEMk">1202</td>
<td id="mwEMo">15.439%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEMs">
<td id="mwEMw"><i id="mwEM0">zhe</i></td>
<td id="mwEM4">719</td>
<td id="mwEM8">9.248%</td>
<td id="mwENA">819</td>
<td id="mwENE">10.533%</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwENI">There are 2,322 characters started with the <i id="mwENM">heng</i> stroke, 29.827% of the dictionary. There are 2,288 characters that end with <i id="mwENQ">heng</i>, or 29.390% of the dictionary.</p>

<p id="mwENU">The data of the table is from an experiment on the 7,784 characters in the <i id="mwENY">Chinese Character Information Dictionary</i>, sorted in descending order of numbers of characters started.<sup about="#mwt643" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTELi1988998_39-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTELi1988998"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTELi1988998-39"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Li"},"2":{"wt":"1988"},"p":{"wt":"998"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTELi1988998-39" id="mwENc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwENg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwENk">[</span>34<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwENo">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<table class="wikitable" id="mwENs">
<caption id="mwENw">Unicode CJK character set first and last strokes of characters<sup about="#mwt646" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-unicode.org_21-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"unicode.org"}}'><a href="#cite_note-unicode.org-21" id="mwEN0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEN4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEN8">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEOA">]</span></span></a></sup></caption>
<tbody id="mwEOE"><tr id="mwEOI">
<th id="mwEOM">Stroke type</th>
<th id="mwEOQ">Characters started</th>
<th id="mwEOU">Frequency (%)</th>
<th id="mwEOY">Characters ended</th>
<th id="mwEOc">Frequency (%)</th></tr>
<tr id="mwEOg">
<td id="mwEOk"><i id="mwEOo">heng</i></td>
<td id="mwEOs">6194</td>
<td id="mwEOw">29.632%</td>
<td id="mwEO0">5819</td>
<td id="mwEO4">27.837%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEO8">
<td id="mwEPA"><i id="mwEPE">pie</i></td>
<td id="mwEPI">4953</td>
<td id="mwEPM">23.695%</td>
<td id="mwEPQ">890</td>
<td id="mwEPU">4.258%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEPY">
<td id="mwEPc"><i id="mwEPg">dian</i></td>
<td id="mwEPk">4506</td>
<td id="mwEPo">21.557%</td>
<td id="mwEPs">8964</td>
<td id="mwEPw">42.882%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEP0">
<td id="mwEP4"><i id="mwEP8">shu</i></td>
<td id="mwEQA">3305</td>
<td id="mwEQE">15.811%</td>
<td id="mwEQI">3089</td>
<td id="mwEQM">14.777%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwEQQ">
<td id="mwEQU"><i id="mwEQY">zhe</i></td>
<td id="mwEQc">1945</td>
<td id="mwEQg">9.305%</td>
<td id="mwEQk">2142</td>
<td id="mwEQo">10.247%</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwEQs">The data is from an experiment on the 20,902 traditional and simplified Chinese characters in the GB13000.1 character set—equivalent to the Unicode BMP CJK character set—sorted by the number of characters started in descending order.<sup about="#mwt647" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999_22-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission1999"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999-22"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission "},"2":{"wt":"1999"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission1999-22" id="mwEQw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEQ0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEQ4">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEQ8">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt650" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_18-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":0"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:0-18" id="mwERA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwERE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwERI">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwERM">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwERQ">The above statistical results on the first and last strokes of Chinese characters made by different people on different character sets are consistent.</p>
<p id="mwERU">The descending orders of strokes by number of characters started are all </p><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt651" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwERY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"holist","href":"./Template:Holist"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;heng&apos;&apos;"},"2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;pie&apos;&apos;"},"3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;dian&apos;&apos;"},"4":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;shu&apos;&apos;"},"5":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;zhe&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1374427404" about="#mwt652" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Hlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div class="hlist" about="#mwt651" id="mwERc"><ol><li><i>heng</i></li><li><i>pie</i></li><li><i>dian</i></li><li><i>shu</i></li><li><i>zhe</i></li></ol></div><p id="mwERg">
and the descending orders of strokes by number of characters ended are all </p><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt653" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwERk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"holist","href":"./Template:Holist"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;dian&apos;&apos;"},"2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;heng&apos;&apos;"},"3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;shu&apos;&apos;"},"4":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;zhe&apos;&apos;"},"5":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;pie&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1374427404" about="#mwt654" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Hlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div class="hlist" about="#mwt653" id="mwERo"><ol><li><i>dian</i></li><li><i>heng</i></li><li><i>shu</i></li><li><i>zhe</i></li><li><i>pie</i></li></ol></div>
<p id="mwERs">Some rules can be drawn from here, such as:
Stroke <i id="mwERw">pie</i> generally does not appear as the last stroke of a character or component, but more often as the first stroke.
Stroke <i id="mwER0">dian</i>, including <i id="mwER4">na</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt655" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwER8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"捺"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>捺</span>), appear more often at the end of characters or components.</p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="33" id="mwESA" aria-labelledby="Eight_Principles_of_Yong"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Eight_Principles_of_Yong">Eight Principles of Yong</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_strokes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=33" title="Edit section: Eight Principles of Yong"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt656" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwESE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Eight Principles of Yong"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt657" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt656" id="mwESI">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eight_Principles_of_Yong" title="Eight Principles of Yong">Eight Principles of Yong</a></div>
<p id="mwESM">The Eight Principles of <i id="mwESQ">Yong</i> explain how to write eight common <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke_(Chinese_character)" title="Stroke (Chinese character)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwESU">strokes</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_script" title="Regular script" id="mwESY">regular script</a> which are found all in one character, <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt658" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwESc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"{{linktext|永}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh"><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/永" title="wikt:永" class="extiw">永</a></span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt658" id="mwESg"/> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt659" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwESk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"p":{"wt":"yǒng"}},"i":0}}]}'>pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt659">:</span><span about="#mwt659"> </span><i about="#mwt659" id="mwESo"><span lang="zh-Latn">yǒng</span></i>, "forever", "permanence"). It was traditionally believed that the frequent practice of these principles as a beginning <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calligraphy" title="Calligraphy" id="mwESs">calligrapher</a> could ensure <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty" title="Beauty" id="mwESw">beauty</a> in one's writing.</p>

<figure class="mw-halign-left" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwES0"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:8_strokes_of_永-zh.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwES4"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:8_strokes_of_永-zh.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/8_strokes_of_%E6%B0%B8-zh.svg/330px-8_strokes_of_%E6%B0%B8-zh.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/8_strokes_of_%E6%B0%B8-zh.svg/960px-8_strokes_of_%E6%B0%B8-zh.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="625" data-file-height="500" data-file-type="drawing" height="224" width="280" class="mw-file-element" id="mwES8"/></a><figcaption id="mwETA">Eight principle strokes extracted from <a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/永" title="wiktionary:永" class="extiw" id="mwETE">永</a>, "eternity" (five basic strokes: D, T, W, P, N and one compound stroke HZG). Enlarge this image to see the red arrows, showing the way of writing of each.</figcaption></figure>
<dl id="mwETI"><dt id="mwETM">Eight basic strokes<sup about="#mwt660" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-37strokes_5-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"37strokes","group":"upper-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-37strokes-5"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Efn-ua","href":"./Template:Efn-ua"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"\"37strokes\""},"1":{"wt":"The extended CJK(V) set of strokes has 29 strokes. These most common 29 used strokes can be reduced to combinations of 8 basic strokes, for a total of 37 strokes. The subset of 8 is found in the character \"eternity\" 永, hence the name of this set. But other sets of CJK(V) strokes can be found."}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-37strokes-5" data-mw-group="upper-alpha" id="mwETQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwETU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwETY">[</span>A<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwETc">]</span></span></a></sup></dt>
<dd id="mwETg"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwETk"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:D_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwETo"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:D_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/D_black.png/40px-D_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/D_black.png/60px-D_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwETs"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwETw">Diǎn</i> 點 / 点, is a dot, filled from the top, to the bottom, traditionally made by "couching" the brush on the page.</dd>
<dd id="mwET0"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwET4"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:H_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwET8"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:H_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/H_black.png/40px-H_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/H_black.png/60px-H_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEUA"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEUE">Héng</i> 横, is horizontal, filled from left to right, the same way the Latin letters A, B, C, D are written.</dd>
<dd id="mwEUI"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwEUM"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:S_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEUQ"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:S_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/S_black.png/40px-S_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/S_black.png/60px-S_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEUU"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEUY">Shù</i> 豎 / 竖, is vertical-falling. The brush begins by a dot on top, then falls downward.</dd>
<dd id="mwEUc"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwEUg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:G_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEUk"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:G_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/G_black.png/40px-G_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/G_black.png/60px-G_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEUo"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEUs">Gōu</i> 鈎(鉤) / 钩, ending another stroke, is a sharp change of direction either down (after a Heng) or left (after a Shù).</dd>
<dd id="mwEUw"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwEU0"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:T_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEU4"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:T_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/T_black.png/40px-T_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/T_black.png/60px-T_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEU8"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEVA">Tí</i> 提 / <i id="mwEVE">Tiāo</i> 提, is a flick up and rightwards.</dd>
<dd id="mwEVI"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwEVM"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:W_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEVQ"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:W_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/W_black.png/40px-W_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/W_black.png/60px-W_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEVU"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEVY">Wān</i> 彎 / 弯, follows a concave path on the left or on the right.</dd>
<dd id="mwEVc"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwEVg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:P_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEVk"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:P_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/P_black.png/40px-P_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/P_black.png/60px-P_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEVo"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEVs">Piě</i> 撇, is a falling leftwards (with a slight curve).</dd>
<dd id="mwEVw"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwEV0"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:N_black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEV4"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:N_black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/N_black.png/40px-N_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/N_black.png/60px-N_black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEV8"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEWA">Nà</i> 捺, is falling rightwards (with an emphasis at the end of the stroke).</dd>
<dd id="mwEWE">(+ <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwEWI"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:XG-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEWM"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:XG-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/XG-black.png/40px-XG-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/XG-black.png/60px-XG-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="25" width="25" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEWQ"/></a></span> － the <i id="mwEWU">Xié</i> 斜 is sometimes added to the 永's strokes. It's a concave <i id="mwEWY">Shù</i> falling right, always ended by a <i id="mwEWc">Gōu</i>).<div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt663" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEWg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"clear","href":"./Template:Clear"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'></div></dd></dl>
<table width="80%" style="margin:1em auto;" id="mwEWk">
<tbody id="mwEWo"><tr id="mwEWs"><td id="mwEWw"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEW0"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:D-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEW4"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:D-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/D-black.png/60px-D-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/D-black.png/120px-D-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEW8"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEXA"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEXE"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:H-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEXI"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:H-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/H-black.png/60px-H-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/H-black.png/120px-H-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEXM"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEXQ"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEXU"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:S-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEXY"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:S-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/S-black.png/60px-S-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/S-black.png/120px-S-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEXc"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEXg"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEXk"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:G-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEXo"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:G-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/G-black.png/60px-G-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/G-black.png/120px-G-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEXs"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEXw"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEX0"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:T-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEX4"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:T-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/T-black.png/60px-T-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/T-black.png/120px-T-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEX8"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEYA"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEYE"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:W-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEYI"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:W-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/W-black.png/60px-W-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/W-black.png/120px-W-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEYM"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEYQ"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEYU"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:P-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEYY"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:P-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/P-black.png/60px-P-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/P-black.png/120px-P-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEYc"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEYg"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEYk"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:N-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEYo"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:N-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/N-black.png/60px-N-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/N-black.png/120px-N-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEYs"/></a></span></td><td id="mwEYw">(<span typeof="mw:File" id="mwEY0"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:XG-black.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwEY4"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:XG-black.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/XG-black.png/60px-XG-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/XG-black.png/120px-XG-black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="bitmap" height="60" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwEY8"/></a></span>)</td></tr>
